# Trial-Size Trial by Wind (outlands 197): Rahi Fohlatti in Rabao. Her default 71 (Rabao's DefaultActions) alternates
# with her script (interaction_lookup's UseFallback, a local var cleared by zoning): with UseFallback 0 a talk plays 71
# and sets it to 1; the next talk runs the script (the call) and resets it to 0, and plays 71 again when the script
# starts nothing. So each script talk below follows a default talk. The guard (main level 20, main job SMN,
# Selbina-Rabao fame level 2): fame 49 not offered (71 on both talks); the offer 108 (0, Mini Tuning Fork of Wind, 3,
# 20) declined, option 2 (nothing), option 1 with a full inventory (ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED: not begun), then begun with
# one free slot (the fork, ITEM_OBTAINED); 68 while the fork is held; the trades (a bone chip: nothing; the fork: 109,
# declined, option 2 (nothing), then option 1: xi.teleport.to the Cloister of Gales, the fork kept; the tick and the
# login finish the zone change). A trade while available is #level19's. Completed by GM: 111; the fork's trade: nothing.
# The fork-lost arms are #fork_lost, the level and job sides #level19 and #not_smn, the battlefield #battlefield.
char zone=Rabao pos=-13.5,7.9,-9.5 job=SMN lvl=20
fame Sandoria 37
fame Bastok 37                            # Selbina-Rabao (37 + 37) * 2 / 3 = 49
item BoneChip
login
trigger Rahi_Fohlatti                     # UseFallback 0: the default 71
finish
trigger Rahi_Fohlatti                     # the script: fame 49 (level 1): the quest's nil; the default 71
finish
fame Sandoria 38
fame Bastok 37                            # Selbina-Rabao 50
trigger Rahi_Fohlatti                     # the default 71
finish
trigger Rahi_Fohlatti                     # the script: SMN 20, fame level 2: 108 (0, fork, 3, 20)
finish option=0                           # declined: nothing
trigger Rahi_Fohlatti                     # the default 71
finish
trigger Rahi_Fohlatti                     # 108
finish option=2                           # option 2: nothing (the finish wants option 1)
trigger Rahi_Fohlatti                     # the default 71
finish
trigger Rahi_Fohlatti                     # 108
fill-inventory
finish option=1                           # no free slot: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED (the fork); not begun
storage inventory 31                      # one free slot (the bag one larger): the test is == 0
trigger Rahi_Fohlatti                     # the default 71
finish
trigger Rahi_Fohlatti                     # 108
finish option=1                           # begun; the Mini Tuning Fork of Wind, ITEM_OBTAINED
free-inventory
trigger Rahi_Fohlatti                     # the default 71
finish
trigger Rahi_Fohlatti                     # accepted, the fork held: 68
finish
trade Rahi_Fohlatti BoneChip x1           # SMN, accepted, not the fork: nothing
trade Rahi_Fohlatti MiniTuningForkOfWind x1 # SMN, accepted, the fork: 109 (0, fork, 3, 20)
finish option=0                           # option 0: nothing, the fork kept
trade Rahi_Fohlatti MiniTuningForkOfWind x1 # 109
finish option=2                           # option 2: nothing, the fork kept
trade Rahi_Fohlatti MiniTuningForkOfWind x1 # 109 again
finish option=1                           # xi.teleport.to the Cloister of Gales (the fork kept)
tick 400                                  # the zone change the teleport set: the char saved at the Cloister of Gales (201)
login                                     # back in at the teleport's destination (-374.919, 0.628, -386.774)
quest Outlands.TrialSizeTrialByWind completed
warp -13.5,7.9,-9.5 Rabao
trigger Rahi_Fohlatti                     # the default 71 (the zone change cleared UseFallback)
finish
trigger Rahi_Fohlatti                     # completed: 111
finish
trade Rahi_Fohlatti MiniTuningForkOfWind x1 # completed: nothing
